@startuml
actor User
participant React
participant FastAPI
participant "Open-Meteo" as Weather
participant "Physical Services" as Physics
User -> React : choose location and system
React -> FastAPI : POST yearly / daily / scenarios
FastAPI -> Weather : request hourly weather
Weather --> FastAPI : radiation, temperature, timestamps
FastAPI -> Physics : validate, losses, simulate, aggregate, finance
Physics --> FastAPI : energy and financial result
FastAPI --> React : typed JSON response
React --> User : charts and values
@enduml
